{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/gnustoscoring"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A game’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxScore"},{"text":" is a literal, read at bootstrap before a single rule has run,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so on its own it is the author’s arithmetic and nothing else. Add a sixth award","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and forget the total, and the game ships with a ceiling the player walks straight","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"past. This library makes the award table the one place a register’s points are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"written, and hands the total to the bootstrap, which compares it against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxScore"},{"text":" and warns when the two disagree.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring"},{"text":" is a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GameContent"},{"text":" bundle rather than a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GamePlugin"},{"text":", because it owns","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"saved state: two sets of register names — the awards already paid, and the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"treasures currently sitting in the trophy case. Both are ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Global"},{"text":", so they","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"namespace under ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Scoring"},{"text":" and ride along in save files. That makes the wiring two","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"steps rather than one. List the instance in the game’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"content"},{"text":" block, then","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"splice its rule factories into the game’s own ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"rules"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Everything the rules operate on is the host’s. The host declares the treasures","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and puts a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".takeValue"},{"text":" and a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".depositValue"},{"text":" on each, declares the trophy case,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and names the rooms whose first entry pays. ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring"},{"text":" reads those traits and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"moves the number; the engine’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"score"},{"text":" verb, status line and end-of-game epilogue","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"do all the reporting.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Take"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" value is paid once per treasure and never taken back — dropping a gem down a well does not refund it. ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Deposit"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" value follows the original Zork’s in-case accounting: credited when the treasure lands in the trophy case, debited when it comes back out, so the displayed score rises and falls as the hoard is rearranged. The ledger follows the case’s ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"contents"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":", not only the verbs that fill and empty it: ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"take"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"put in"},{"text":" settle it on the spot, and anything else that moves a treasure — a thief lifting one out of the case, a death that scatters the inventory — is caught at the start of the next turn that costs one. A free ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"score"},{"text":" typed straight after such a theft still reads the old number; the next ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"wait"},{"text":" corrects it. ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/awardOnce(_:)"},{"text":" on a register missing from the table is a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"fatalError"},{"text":" rather than a silent zero, because a typo that pays nothing puts the game quietly past its own maximum and nothing else would catch it.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Wiring","text":"Wiring","type":"heading","level":2},{"syntax":"swift","code":["import Gnusto","import GnustoScoring","","struct Hoard: Game {","    let title = \"Hoard\"","    let maxScore = 38","","    let scoring = Scoring(awards: [\"cellar\": 25])","","    let cellar = Location { name(\"Cellar\"); description(\"A low, dirt-floored cellar.\") }","    let idol = Item {","        name(\"jade idol\")","        trait(.takeValue, 5)","        trait(.depositValue, 8)","    }","    let trophyCase = Item { name(\"trophy case\"); container; openable; transparent }","","    var content: GameContents { scoring }","","    var rules: Rules {","        scoring.treasures([idol], into: trophyCase)","        scoring.visit(cellar, register: \"cellar\")","    }","","    var map: WorldMap { … }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"25 for the cellar, 5 for taking the idol, 8 for casing it: 38, which is what","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxScore"},{"text":" says. Change any one of the three and the bootstrap says so.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"An award that fires from somewhere other than a room entry calls","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/awardOnce(_:)"},{"text":" from inside any rule body, and reads its points from","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the same table:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["beacon.after(.turnOn) {","    scoring.awardOnce(\"beacon\")","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/penalize(_:)"},{"text":" is the other direction, and is deliberately not","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"registered — a death toll is charged every time. The score is a plain ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int"},{"text":" with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"no floor, so it can go negative, as it does in the original after an early death.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Treasure values are not listed in the award table. They are already declared on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the items, and ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/declaredMaxScore(items:)"},{"text":" sums them off the world. A","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"game with an empty table and no valued treasures declares nothing and opts out of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the check.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Worked-examples","text":"Worked examples","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sources\/Lighthouse\/"},{"text":" is the shortest: two event awards, one through","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/visit(_:register:)"},{"text":" and one through ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/awardOnce(_:)"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sources\/Zork1\/"},{"text":" is the full shape — five event awards plus nineteen treasures","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"whose take and deposit values total exactly the original’s 350.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"topicSections":[{"title":"The content bundle","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring","doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/init(awards:)","doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/awards"],"anchor":"The-content-bundle"},{"title":"Rules the host splices","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/treasures(_:into:)","doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/visit(_:register:)"],"anchor":"Rules-the-host-splices"},{"title":"Scoring from a rule body","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/awardOnce(_:)","doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/penalize(_:)"],"anchor":"Scoring-from-a-rule-body"},{"title":"Declaring a treasure’s value","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Gnusto\/TraitKey\/takeValue","doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Gnusto\/TraitKey\/depositValue"],"anchor":"Declaring-a-treasures-value"},{"title":"Checking the total","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/declaredMaxScore(items:)"],"anchor":"Checking-the-total"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Treasure and event scoring, over an award table the bootstrap can add up.","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"title":"GnustoScoring","symbolKind":"module","modules":[{"name":"GnustoScoring"}],"role":"collection","externalID":"GnustoScoring","roleHeading":"Framework"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://GnustoScoring/documentation/GnustoScoring/Scoring/penalize(_:)":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoscoring\/scoring\/penalize(_:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/penalize(_:)","title":"penalize(_:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"penalize"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Deducts "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"points"},{"type":"text","text":" from the score — the flip side of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"awardOnce"},{"type":"text","text":", for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"penalties that aren’t award-once (a death toll charged every time)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Unlike an award, this is not registered and can repeat."}]},"doc://GnustoScoring/documentation/GnustoScoring/Scoring/declaredMaxScore(items:)":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoscoring\/scoring\/declaredmaxscore(items:)","title":"declaredMaxScore(items:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/declaredMaxScore(items:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"declaredMaxScore"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"items"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto4ItemV","text":"Item"},{"kind":"text","text":"]) -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Everything this plugin can pay over a complete playthrough: the declared"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/awards"},{"type":"text","text":" table, plus every treasure’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".takeValue"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".depositValue"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The bootstrap compares the total against the game’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxScore"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},"doc://GnustoScoring/documentation/GnustoScoring/Scoring/awardOnce(_:)":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoscoring\/scoring\/awardonce(_:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/awardOnce(_:)","title":"awardOnce(_:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"awardOnce"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Awards a register’s declared points exactly once; later calls with the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"same name are silent no-ops, as is a zero-point award. Callable from"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"any rule body:"}]},"doc://GnustoScoring/documentation/GnustoScoring/Gnusto/TraitKey/takeValue":{"type":"topic","conformance":{"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}],"constraints":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Value"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"availabilityPrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Available when"}]},"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoscoring\/gnusto\/traitkey\/takevalue","title":"takeValue","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Gnusto\/TraitKey\/takeValue","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"takeValue","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8TraitKeyV","text":"TraitKey"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Points awarded the first time this treasure is taken."}]},"doc://GnustoScoring/documentation/GnustoScoring/Scoring":{"title":"Scoring","abstract":[{"text":"Treasure scoring: typed point values on items, a declared table of","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"award-once registers, and take\/deposit wiring for a trophy case. Add it to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a game’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"content"},{"text":" block, name every award it can pay, put values on the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"treasures, and splice one factory call into the rules:","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gnustoscoring\/scoring","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Scoring"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Scoring"}]},"doc://GnustoScoring/documentation/GnustoScoring/Scoring/awards":{"title":"awards","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Every award-once register this game can pay, and what each pays. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"single source of truth: "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/awardOnce(_:)"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/visit(_:register:)"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"read their points from here rather than carrying them at the call site,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so the total the bootstrap checks is the total the game pays.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gnustoscoring\/scoring\/awards","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/awards","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"awards","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}]},"doc://GnustoScoring/documentation/GnustoScoring/Scoring/treasures(_:into:)":{"title":"treasures(_:into:)","abstract":[{"text":"For each treasure: the first ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"take"},{"text":" pays its ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".takeValue"},{"text":" (once, for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"good), and its ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".depositValue"},{"text":" follows the trophy case — credited when","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the treasure lands inside, debited when it is taken back out, the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"original’s in-case accounting. Register keys derive from the item’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"entity ID (“take.greenGem”) — the property it was declared as, dotted","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"under its bundle for a treasure a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GameContent"},{"text":" declares","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(“take.AtticContent.greenGem”) — so two treasures that share a display","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"name still score separately, and rewording a treasure’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"name"},{"text":" in a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"later build does not strand the credit a player’s save is holding.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gnustoscoring\/scoring\/treasures(_:into:)","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/treasures(_:into:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"treasures","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"([","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto4ItemV","text":"Item","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"], ","kind":"text"},{"text":"into","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto4ItemV","text":"Item","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto5RulesV","text":"Rules","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]},"doc://GnustoScoring/documentation/GnustoScoring/Scoring/init(awards:)":{"title":"init(awards:)","abstract":[{"text":"Creates the scoring content.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gnustoscoring\/scoring\/init(awards:)","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/init(awards:)","fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"awards","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"])","kind":"text"}]},"doc://GnustoScoring/documentation/GnustoScoring":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Treasure and event scoring, over an award table the bootstrap can add up."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring","title":"GnustoScoring","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoscoring","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://GnustoScoring/documentation/GnustoScoring/Gnusto/TraitKey/depositValue":{"type":"topic","conformance":{"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}],"constraints":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Value"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"availabilityPrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Available when"}]},"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoscoring\/gnusto\/traitkey\/depositvalue","title":"depositValue","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Gnusto\/TraitKey\/depositValue","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"depositValue"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8TraitKeyV","text":"TraitKey"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Points awarded the first time this treasure lands in the trophy case."}]},"doc://GnustoScoring/documentation/GnustoScoring/Scoring/visit(_:register:)":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoscoring\/scoring\/visit(_:register:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/visit(_:register:)","title":"visit(_:register:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"visit"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8LocationV","text":"Location"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"register"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto4RuleV","text":"Rule"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onEnter"},{"type":"text","text":" rule that pays "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"register"},{"type":"text","text":"‘s declared points the first time"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the player enters "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"room"},{"type":"text","text":", through "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"awardOnce"},{"type":"text","text":" — the event-scoring idiom"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(Zork’s “into the cellar, +25”). Splice into the host’s rules:"}]}}}